sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Local Companion
    participant DO as Installation Relay DO
    participant W as Public Edge Worker
    participant T as Telegram
    participant U as User

    C->>DO: outbound authenticated WSS
    C->>DO: sanitized Attention projection
    DO->>W: route notification projection
    W->>T: send message / opaque callback buttons
    T->>U: NEEDS YOU / OUTCOME / progress

    U->>T: bounded callback
    T->>W: webhook + opaque fa:a:token
    W->>W: validate webhook + paired private user/chat
    W->>DO: mapped exact bounded action intent
    DO->>C: action.intent
    C-->>DO: action.received
    C->>C: canonical revalidation
    C->>C: ResolutionPort if permitted
    C-->>DO: action.result
    DO-->>W: result projection
    W-->>T: update message
    T-->>U: canonical result

    Note over W,C: High-risk: notification/local confirmation only